            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-02-26",
            "actionTime": "13:08:36",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - The House resumed debate on H.J. Res. 35.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-02-26",
            "actionTime": "12:20:47",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.J. Res. 35.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H8D000",
            "actionDate": "2025-02-26",
            "actionTime": "12:20:00",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.J. Res. 20, H.J. Res. 35 and H. Con. Res. 14. The resolution provides for consideration of two joint resolutions, H.J.Res.20, under a closed rule and H.J.Res. 35, under a closed rule. Also, the resolution provides for consideration of H. Con. Res. 14, under a closed rule. The joint resolutions are debated for one hour each and the concurrent resolution is debated for 3 hours.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H30000",
            "actionDate": "2025-02-26",
            "actionTime": "12:19:55",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 161. (consideration: CR H846-853)",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
        {
            "actionCode": "H1L210",
            "actionDate": "2025-02-25",
            "actionTime": "10:35:04",
            "sourceSystem": {
                "code": 2,
                "name": "House floor actions"
            },
            "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 161 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.J. Res. 20, H.J. Res. 35 and H. Con. Res. 14. The resolution provides for consideration of two joint resolutions, H.J.Res.20, under a closed rule and H.J.Res. 35, under a closed rule. Also, the resolution provides for consideration of H. Con. Res. 14, under a closed rule. The joint resolutions are debatable for one hour each and the concurrent resolution is debatable for 3 hours.",
            "type": "Floor"
        },
